msgctxt "3704"
msgid "Did you know I was on TV?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3716"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "3728"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I was on the show \"Fright Night.\" I was the defendant in the "
"\"Troubled Lovers Courtroom\" segment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3740"
msgid "Defendant? Not the plaintiff...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3752"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh. These three guys accused me of stuff, like, \"Yui lied to me the "
"whole time!\" Or, \"She swindled me out of all my money!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3764"
msgid "They actually took me to court over it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3776"
msgid "Sounds intense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3788"
msgid "Kinda. I had no idea why they went through all that trouble, though. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3800"
msgid ""
"I mean, I never forced them to do anything. I just said I wanted something, "
"and they bought it. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3812"
msgid "So why sue me? I don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3824"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3836"
msgid ""
"They kept yelling for me to apologize to them, and I was like, \"Uh, are you"
" dumb? Why should I apologize?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3848"
msgid "That's how you got them to buy you things?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3860"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ I mean, it's not like I was doing it on purpose or anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3872"
msgid ""
"My friends do say that I shouldn't make guys buy me stuff all the time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3884"
msgid "Sounds like you might be overdoing it a little, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3896"
msgid "Hehehe... Maybe a little. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3908"
msgid "Sounds like you brought that on yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3920"
msgid ""
"What? That's not true! If they didn't want to buy me anything, they could've"
" just said no!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3932"
msgid "I suppose that's true..."
msgstr "Suppongo che sia vero."

msgctxt "3944"
msgid ""
"My friends do say that I shouldn't make guys buy me stuff all the time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3956"
msgid "Hehehe... Oops? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3968"
msgid "You did nothing wrong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3980"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Thank you, Kiryu-san! I'm so glad you get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3992"
msgid "I mean, it's not like I forced them to buy anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4004"
msgid "I just screamed, \"I WAAAAAAANT IT!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4016"
msgid ""
"...Right in the middle of the store. That was it! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4028"
msgid "Heh. That's all it took for them to buckle?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4040"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I don't know why all these people are mad at me for it! Why should I "
"apologize when I didn't do anything wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4052"
msgid "Ugh... I'm in a real bind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4064"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "4076"
msgid "So I went to the salon yesterday, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4088"
msgid "One of the girls doing my hair asked me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4100"
msgid "\"Yui-san, you've gotten a little chubby, haven't you?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4112"
msgid "Can you believe it? She actually called me chubby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4124"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "4136"
msgid "So when I got home, I jumped on the scale, just to make sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4148"
msgid "And the number on the scale freaked me out! Do you know what it was?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4160"
msgid "What was it?"
msgstr "Che cos'era?"

msgctxt "4172"
msgid ""
"Well, I can't tell you that, obviously! And you're not supposed to ask, "
"Kiryu-san! So I'm not telling. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4184"
msgid "Heh. All right then."
msgstr "Ah. Va bene, allora."

msgctxt "4196"
msgid "Before I started working here, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4208"
msgid "I was pretty underweight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4220"
msgid "...Do you mind if I ask why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4232"
msgid "Hehe. ♪ You really want to know? You suuuure you want to know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4244"
msgid "In all seriousness, I was actually kind of sick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4256"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4268"
msgid ""
"Forget about that, though. The important thing is that I was basically this "
"sad sack of skin and bones way back when."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4280"
msgid "One of my friends was pretty worried about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4292"
msgid ""
"She kept telling me, \"Yui, you have to gain more weight!\"\r\n"
"\"Eat here, you might put on a few more pounds that way!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4304"
msgid ""
"Then, when I got into this club and started my trial period, she told me to "
"work my butt off... or on, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4316"
msgid ""
"So basically, the whole reason I started working as a hostess was to try and"
" gain some weight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4328"
msgid "I'm glad to hear you're doing better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4340"
msgid "Are you back to a normal weight now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4352"
msgid "Yep! ♪ I'm at a healthy weight now for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4364"
msgid "Still, I'm a little concerned. Am I a good chubby, or a bad chubby?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4376"
msgid "I don't see the problem with being chubby, as long as you're healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4388"
msgid "You're right! It's a healthy chubby!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4400"
msgid "I'm feeling so much better now. Happy, even. Chubby and happy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4412"
msgid "Heh, good."
msgstr "Heh. Bene."

msgctxt "4424"
msgid ""
"This calls for a celebration! You know what, I'm gonna have a drink today! "
"Let's break out the champagne!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4436"
msgid "Only today? You know you're going to drink tomorrow, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4448"
msgid "Yup! I sure am! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4460"
msgid "What a great friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4472"
msgid "I know, right? I'm so lucky to have her. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4484"
msgid "Definitely."
msgstr "Assolutamente."

msgctxt "4496"
msgid "But I guess I have to admit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4508"
msgid "She's just a liiiiittle bit cuter than I am. Juuuust a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4520"
msgid "Just a little?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4532"
msgid ""
"Well... maybe a lot cuter. I have this tendency to either\r\n"
"underexaggerate things or blow them way out of proportion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4544"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪"
msgstr "Eheheh. ♪"

msgctxt "4556"
msgid "If you say so, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4568"
msgid "Why were you sick?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4580"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

msgctxt "4592"
msgid ""
"You know how I was on TV before? People were pretty mean to me about it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4604"
msgid "Really..."
msgstr "Davvero...?"

msgctxt "4616"
msgid "Yeah. It made it pretty hard for me to trust people after that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4628"
msgid "Looking back on it now, I was in a pretty bad place back then, haha. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4640"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Eh."

msgctxt "4652"
msgid ""
"But I'm totally fine now, so don't worry about it. I'm chubby, healthy, and "
"happy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4664"
msgid "Hehehe! ♪"
msgstr "Eheheh! ♪"

msgctxt "4676"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr "Bene."

msgctxt "4688"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... ♪ You're really cool, Kiryu-san! You're so dreamy,\r\n"
"too... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4700"
msgid "Huh? Where'd this come from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4712"
msgid ""
"Well... You might say I'm not the sharpest tool in the shed. I have a lot of"
" trouble dealing with people who are super complicated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4724"
msgid "Uh-huh..."
msgstr "Uh-uh..."

msgctxt "4736"
msgid "Sometimes, I get these guys, who are like..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4748"
msgid ""
"Really quiet and thoughtful, to the point where I have no idea what they're "
"thinking even after talking with them for hours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4760"
msgid "I get so antsy, talking to guys like that!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4772"
msgid ""
"That's why I've got a total soft spot for guys with a one-track mind, like "
"you, Kiryu-san! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4784"
msgid "A one-track mind?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4796"
msgid "Yeah! I've had tons of people tell me I'm like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4808"
msgid " No, I meant what you said about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4820"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "4832"
msgid "You really think I'm that simple?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4844"
msgid "Yup! ♪ That's how you come off to me, at least!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4856"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4868"
msgid "You know, I could be more complex than I look."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4880"
msgid "Hehehe... ♪"
msgstr "Ehehe..."

msgctxt "4892"
msgid "Well, maybe, but I'm pretty confident I know one thing about you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4904"
msgid "And what's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4916"
msgid "You are definitely way smarter than me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4928"
msgid "Heh, I'll take it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4940"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4952"
msgid ""
"Hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I mean, you're pretty much what I'd consider"
" to be the perfect guy, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4964"
msgid "Whoops! Did I just say that out loud?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4976"
msgid "Oh man, what is with me today? I'm so embarrassed..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4988"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. ♪ Maybe I should lay off the drinks. Just forget I ever said that, "
"okay? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5000"
msgid "You got it..."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "5012"
msgid "You've got the wrong idea about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5024"
msgid "Wait, really!?"
msgstr "Aspetta, sul serio?"

msgctxt "5036"
msgid "I spend a lot of time thinking about things, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5048"
msgid "No way! Wait, so what are you thinking about right now, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5060"
msgid "...I can't say it out loud, not here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5072"
msgid "Huh? Is it really that bad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5084"
msgid ""
"Man, I was hoping you could just straight-up tell me without being all "
"mysterious..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5096"
msgid "You're no fun, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5108"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5120"
msgid "Ugh, I want a boyfriend..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5132"
msgid "Where's this coming from?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5144"
msgid "I mean, I've been looking for one for a while..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5156"
msgid ""
"But I've been getting so desperate lately. I just want to be able to say, "
"\"Look out world, 'cause I've got a boyfriend!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5168"
msgid "...You just want to be able to say you have a boyfriend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5180"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. Yeah. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> That's why I've been thinking, maybe"
" I should be putting myself out there more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5192"
msgid "What kind of guy are you looking for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5204"
msgid "Well, for one, a guy who can put up with how selfish I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5216"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Va bene..."

msgctxt "5228"
msgid ""
"Like, there was this one time, my ex and I were driving up from Osaka to "
"visit Himeji Castle..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5240"
msgid "When all of a sudden, I got this major craving for boba!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5252"
msgid ""
"And the first place that popped into my mind was in Nagoya. It's this really"
" famous place that makes the best milk tea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5264"
msgid ""
"So my ex got off the highway, made a U-turn, and went all the way down to "
"Nagoya! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5276"
msgid ""
"I want a guy who can put up with my crazy impulses, like my ex did. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5288"
msgid "I hope you find someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5300"
msgid "Wait, what!? Kiryu-san! That's not what you were supposed to say!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5312"
msgid "You were supposed to go, \"Heh. Don't worry, Yui. I'll put up with you.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5324"
msgid "Come on, man..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5336"
msgid "I... really do hope you find someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5348"
msgid "Awww! You're not gonna say it, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5360"
msgid "Heh, sorry."
msgstr "Eh, scusa."

msgctxt "5372"
msgid "Wait, isn't Nagoya in the complete opposite direction?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5384"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "5396"
msgid "I'm surprised he went that far out of his way for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5408"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ That's love, though, don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5420"
msgid "I think he had it pretty rough..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5432"
msgid "So he should be completely subservient to your whims."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5444"
msgid "I mean, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5456"
msgid "Well all right, then."
msgstr "Bene, allora."

msgctxt "5468"
msgid "What, you wouldn't have turned around for me, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5480"
msgid "I don't know. It would depend on the actual situation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5492"
msgid ""
"I guess you're right. You know, one of my ex-boyfriends said something like "
"that to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5504"
msgid "\"I never thought I'd ever be able to put up with all your demands.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5516"
msgid "But I guess he did, in the end!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5528"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5540"
msgid ""
"So lately, I've been really into the whole glaudy trend. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5552"
msgid "...Glaudy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5564"
msgid ""
" Yeah, it's a cross between glittery and gaudy. You've seen those sparkly "
"watches some girls wear, right? You can make them even more gaudy and "
"glittery. Glaudy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5576"
msgid "I still don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5588"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "5600"
msgid "It went way over my head, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5612"
msgid "It's like, all blinged out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5624"
msgid "Blinged... out?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5636"
msgid "Yeah, bling! Like, super gaudy accessories and stuff! You know!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5648"
msgid ""
"All these shops have started selling these cute little things to make "
"yourself more blinged out!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5660"
msgid "Like little roses, or pink bees, or fake diamonds..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5672"
msgid ""
"They're stickers you can put on stuff to make patterns or cute little faces!"
" ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5684"
msgid "It's super fun! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5696"
msgid "What's so fun about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5708"
msgid ""
"The whole decorating aspect of it! It gets me, like, so hype to show it off."
" <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5720"
msgid "Uh... huh..."
msgstr "Uh... uh..."

msgctxt "5732"
msgid ""
"I like making my blinged-out stuff look super gorge. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I can barely control my hype when I get it looking"
" juuust right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5744"
msgid "Super... gorge...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5756"
msgid "I'm still having a hard time imagining it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5768"
msgid "Hmm... I wish I had something I could show you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5780"
msgid "I don't have any blinged-out stuff on me right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5792"
msgid "If I did, you'd get what I mean like, right away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5804"
msgid "Ugh, I wish there were a better way to explain it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5816"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5828"
msgid "You should help me get all \"blinged out,\" too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5840"
msgid "Wait, really? You wanna give it a try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5852"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr "Certo, perché no?"

msgctxt "5864"
msgid "Ooh, I've got the perfect idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5876"
msgid "I'll bling out your phone! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5888"
msgid "My... phone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5900"
msgid "Come on, it'll be fun! Let's make it super glaudy. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5912"
msgid ""
"It's the price you've gotta pay to be friends with me! How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5924"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Uff..."

msgctxt "5936"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "5948"
msgid "I want to be a headliner... What should I do to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5960"
msgid "A headliner? Like, in a show?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5972"
msgid ""
"No, not like that! Like, someone who's in all the headlines! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5984"
msgid "I... have no idea what you're getting at."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5996"
msgid ""
"Come on! Super rich and famous? Like, one of those starlets that's always in"
" the news?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6008"
msgid ""
"A girl who's so rich and glamorous, everyone wants to know her every move! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6020"
msgid "Uh-huh..."
msgstr "Uh-uh..."

msgctxt "6032"
msgid "So, what do you think I should do to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6044"
msgid "How should I know?"
msgstr "E che ne so io?"

msgctxt "6056"
msgid "Aww, come on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6068"
msgid "You're so mean, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6080"
msgid ""
"You know, you're gonna regret saying that to me once I'm rich and famous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6092"
msgid "I'd be surprised if you actually did end up rich and famous."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6104"
msgid "Whaaaat!? You don't think I will!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6116"
msgid "Nope. Sorry."
msgstr "Nah. Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "6128"
msgid "Oh, I get it! You're just teasing me, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6140"
msgid "Because you secretly think I'm cute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6152"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "6164"
msgid ""
"Come on, Kiryu-san, I'm not some little kid. You can't fool me! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6176"
msgid "I have no idea where you're going with this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6188"
msgid "Be my girl."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6200"
msgid "Huh? Wait, what!?"
msgstr "Eh? Aspetta, cooosa?"

msgctxt "6212"
msgid "Gosh, I wasn't expecting that. I dunno what to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6224"
msgid "I'm just kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6236"
msgid ""
"Geez, Kiryu-san, you don't hold back when it comes to that stuff, huh? You "
"aggressive beast of a man. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6248"
msgid "...Hehe, just kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6260"
msgid "Why would you want to do that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6272"
msgid ""
"Who wouldn't want to be rich and famous? All those hot, rich women are soooo"
" cool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6284"
msgid "Hot and rich..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6296"
msgid "Man, I wish I were hot and rich! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6308"
msgid "Well, uh... Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6320"
msgid "Sometimes, I feel like nobody cares about me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6332"
msgid "Like whenever I get sick, nobody even notices."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6344"
msgid "How does that happen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6356"
msgid ""
"So you know how I'm pale, right? Whenever I get sick or have a fever, my "
"skin gets really flushed, and it makes me look healthier than I actually am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6368"
msgid ""
"When I tell people I'm actually sick, they always think I'm lying to them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6380"
msgid ""
"There was this thing that happened when I was in elementary school, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6392"
msgid ""
"I was playing in a river with some friends when I suddenly got swept "
"underwater by the current. I was this close to drowning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6404"
msgid ""
"Even back then, nobody believed me! I was thrashing about in the water, but "
"everyone laughed at me and told me to \"stop messing around\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6416"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6428"
msgid "If it weren't for a fisherman jumping in after me, well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6440"
msgid "I probably wouldn't be here today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6452"
msgid "Sounds like it was a close call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6464"
msgid "Yeah. It wasn't funny at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6476"
msgid "I mean, I don't mind everyone treating me like the class clown."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6488"
msgid "But I expect people to come and help me when my life is in danger!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6500"
msgid "Someone did help you though, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6512"
msgid "Well, yeah, but..."
msgstr "Beh, sì, ma..."

msgctxt "6524"
msgid "Then what's the problem?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6536"
msgid ""
"I mean, what would you have done if you saw me out in the water like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6548"
msgid "I would've rescued you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6560"
msgid "Hehehe... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6572"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "E di che."

msgctxt "6584"
msgid ""
"Aww, you're just saying that! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Maybe I should jump "
"into a river again, see what happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6596"
msgid "Maybe this is why you weren't taken seriously..."
