msgstr ""

msgctxt "9884"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "9896"
msgid "Yeah. All of a sudden, she'll whisper, \"Someone's in the hall...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9908"
msgid ""
"I look, but there's no one there. So I'll turn to her and ask, \"How long "
"have they been there?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9920"
msgid "And she'll say, \"Oh, they've been here the whole time.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9932"
msgid ""
"The whole time! She's been here for four days! So she's been seeing this "
"ghost in my apartment for four days without saying a word!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9944"
msgid ""
"Do you know what's worse than having a creepy ghost in your house? Having a "
"creepy friend in your house saying there are creepy ghosts in your house!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9956"
msgid "Heh. Sounds like quite the ordeal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9968"
msgid ""
"It is! I'm terrified to be in my apartment with her, but I'm terrified to be"
" there alone! I'm too terrified to go home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9980"
msgid "What am I gonna do!?"
msgstr "Cosa farò?"

msgctxt "9992"
msgid "A ghost, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10004"
msgid "Huh? Wait, what are you looking at?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10016"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10028"
msgid "Seriously, what! Do you see something!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10040"
msgid "...No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10052"
msgid "Really!? Are you sure!? There's really nothing here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10064"
msgid "Heh, sorry, I'm just messing around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10076"
msgid ""
"Sheesh, you're gonna give me a heart attack! I seriously thought you were "
"looking at a ghost or something!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10088"
msgid "I can't deal with scary stuff, so please don't do that again, okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10100"
msgid "Are you that scared of ghosts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10112"
msgid "Yes! I can't handle anything about them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10124"
msgid "...Then I have bad news for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10136"
msgid "Wha...? Can you see them too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10148"
msgid "Nope, no paranormal abilities here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10160"
msgid "What!? Oh geez, you were just messing around, weren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10172"
msgid "Uh, yeah..."
msgstr "Oh, già..."

msgctxt "10184"
msgid "Could you seriously cut it out with that stuff?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10196"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr "S... scusa."

msgctxt "10208"
msgid "Want me to walk you home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10220"
msgid "Huh!? Wait, why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10232"
msgid "Well, you're scared to go home, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10244"
msgid "Oh, wow, really? That's so nice of you! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10256"
msgid ""
"It makes me super happy to hear that you want to walk\r\n"
"me home. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10268"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "10280"
msgid "Oh! But we can't, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10292"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Ne sei sicuro?"

msgctxt "10304"
msgid "I mean, what if you give in to your carnal desires and embrace me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10316"
msgid "I might not be able to resist. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10328"
msgid "Heh, we'll see what happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10340"
msgid "I'm still technically single, you know. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10352"
msgid "I'm onto you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10364"
msgid "Ask your friend to walk home with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10376"
msgid "Ooh! I could totally do that. Not a bad idea, actually."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10388"
msgid "No, wait!"
msgstr "No, aspetta!"

msgctxt "10400"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "10412"
msgid "My friend is pretty creepy, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10424"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "10436"
msgid "So, if my creepy friend takes me back to a creepy place..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10448"
msgid "That'll be like, double creepy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10460"
msgid "Heh. Better watch out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10472"
msgid "Noooo! Now I'm even more terrified to go back there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10484"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10496"
msgid "One of our customers got out of control today..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10508"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "10520"
msgid ""
"He asked a girl on an after-hours date, but when she turned him down, he got"
" super angry. Apparently he kept insisting that she come with him, and he "
"caused a huge scene..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10532"
msgid "When I heard the story, I thought it reminded me of myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10544"
msgid "How so?"
msgstr "In che senso?"

msgctxt "10556"
msgid ""
"Before I started working here, I worked at a different hostess club... until"
" I got into a fight with another one of the girls and had to quit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10568"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "10580"
msgid ""
"At the other club, I had a lot of freedom to do what I wanted, and my sales "
"were pretty good, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10592"
msgid "Sounds nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10604"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I asked for some time off, but when I got back, some girl I didn't "
"know very well was working there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10616"
msgid ""
"Apparently, while I was gone, she was telling people how much she looked up "
"to me and everything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10628"
msgid ""
"But the day I got back, she got super drunk and started yelling at me, "
"accusing me of badmouthing her behind her back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10640"
msgid ""
"I didn't really know who she was, so I asked her, \"Uh, who are you again?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10652"
msgid ""
"She got super mad about that and said, \"Is that how you want to play this, "
"huh!? Let's take this outside!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10664"
msgid ""
"So we went outside, where she kept yelling and screaming at me. The busboys "
"had to come outside and hold her back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10676"
msgid "I quit right on the spot. I didn't want to work there a second longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10688"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "10700"
msgid "I think the other girls held a grudge against me, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10712"
msgid "Were they jealous?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10724"
msgid ""
"Jealous of what? It's not like I was trying to start a fight with anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10736"
msgid ""
"Like, I'm not that dumb to want to pick fights with other girls at the club!"
" And I'm not going to apologize to her when she started it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10748"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10760"
msgid "Forget about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10772"
msgid "When you're good at your job, someone's bound to be jealous of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10784"
msgid "I guess you're right... It's such a pain in the butt, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10796"
msgid "You're having a good time now, though, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10808"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I sure am! <Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10820"
msgid "I get to share a drink with you, after all. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10832"
msgid "Heh. I like drinking with you, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10844"
msgid "That must've been rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10856"
msgid ""
"Honestly, it really wasn't. It's not like I was trying to start a fight with"
" anyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10868"
msgid ""
"Like, I'm not that dumb to want to pick fights with other girls at the club!"
" And I'm not going to apologize to her when she started it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10880"
msgid "Even so... That's not a situation anyone would want to be in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10892"
msgid "You'll never guess what happened to me earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10904"
msgid ""
"I was just walking down the street when a group of five b-boy-looking dudes "
"shoved me out of their way and knocked me to the ground!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10916"
msgid "What? For no reason?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10928"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Completely out of nowhere! I was just minding my own business, then "
"boom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10940"
msgid "I was about to get up and chase after them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10952"
msgid ""
"But then I realized that when they knocked me down, I fell butt-first into "
"this huge flower vase!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10964"
msgid "It was so hilarious, I had to take a picture!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10976"
msgid "Huh? Wait, how?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10988"
msgid ""
"There was another hostess walking down the street, so I flagged her down to "
"snap a photo for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11000"
msgid "Here, let me show you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11024"
msgid "真っ黒中。フラグ立てたりWdrResetしたり。"
msgstr ""
"È tutto nero, qui dentro. Imposto dei flag, resetto Wdr e via dicendo."

msgctxt "11060"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Isn't that hilarious?"
