msgctxt "11072"
msgid "It's not funny at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11084"
msgid ""
"What? Why not? I mean, how random is it that my butt just perfectly fit into"
" that vase?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11096"
msgid ""
"All my friends laughed super hard when they saw that picture! They thought "
"it was to die for. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11108"
msgid "What about the guys who shoved you? Did they get away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11120"
msgid "By the time I got the picture, they were gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11132"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11144"
msgid "Was it worth the risk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11156"
msgid ""
"Uh, yeah! Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Isn't that picture just the best"
" thing ever? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11168"
msgid ""
"The lady who took it actually made sure I was all framed up nice and "
"everything. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11180"
msgid "I guess."
msgstr "Forse."

msgctxt "11192"
msgid ""
"All my friends laughed super hard when they saw that picture! They thought "
"it was to die for. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11204"
msgid "...Wait a second."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11216"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "Mmh?"

msgctxt "11228"
msgid "What about the guys who shoved you? Did they get away?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11240"
msgid ""
"You mean the b-boy dudes? By the time I got the picture, they were gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11252"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11264"
msgid "Did you go after them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11276"
msgid "Huh? Oh, you mean the b-boy dudes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11288"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "11300"
msgid "By the time I got the picture, they were gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11312"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11324"
msgid "Today, I'm gonna teach you my favorite motto. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11336"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Cos'è?"

msgctxt "11348"
msgid "\"The person sitting next to you is at the same level you are!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11360"
msgid "...Huh."
msgstr "...Eh."

msgctxt "11372"
msgid "Well? What do you think? Cool, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11384"
msgid "Did you come up with that yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11396"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Nope, I totally stole it from someone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11408"
msgid "Heh, at least you're honest about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11420"
msgid "I randomly remembered it when I was lying in bed last night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11432"
msgid "I figured I'd tell you about it, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11444"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "11456"
msgid ""
"I got it from my big sister. I have so much love and respect for her, you "
"know? One time, she turned to me and said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11468"
msgid ""
"\"If you want to know where you stand in the world, just take a look at the "
"man sitting next to you!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11480"
msgid "Your sister sounds pretty cool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11492"
msgid ""
"I know, right? She's the coolest person I know! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11504"
msgid "So, what level are you on, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11516"
msgid "Hehehe... ♪ My level?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11528"
msgid ""
"Come on, Kiryu-san, you know if I told you that, you'd know your level too, "
"right? I can't tell you that. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11540"
msgid "...Should I be happy about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11552"
msgid "I hope you can be just like her someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11564"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I secretly hope so, too. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11576"
msgid "...I thought you wanted to be a headliner, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11588"
msgid "Well, I'm gonna be a headliner, too! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11600"
msgid "...Good luck with that."
msgstr "Buona fortuna, allora."

msgctxt "11612"
msgid "You should introduce me to her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11624"
msgid "Huh!? Are you kidding!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11636"
msgid "...Is that a no?"
msgstr "...Quindi è un no?"

msgctxt "11648"
msgid "No, but like, it's so sudden! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11660"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "11672"
msgid ""
"I think we have a little ways to go before I can introduce you to my sister,"
" Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11684"
msgid "I think you've got the wrong idea..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11696"
msgid ""
"Ugh, I just can't handle ghosts and monsters and all that spooky stuff!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11708"
msgid ""
"Whenever I'm alone at night, like in a hotel room or something, I get so "
"scared, I start crying!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11720"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "11732"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Like, when a TV show ends, I rush to call a friend as soon as I can, "
"and I'm practically in tears when they pick up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11744"
msgid ""
"I'm all like, \"The show just ended, and now it's super quiet and scary in "
"here!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11756"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Eh..."

msgctxt "11768"
msgid ""
"And my friends are super mean to me about it! They're like, \"Who cares!?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11780"
msgid ""
"One time I asked them what I should do if I get attacked by a ghost, and "
"they just told me to just \"pray it away\"!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11792"
msgid ""
"How am I supposed to be able to focus on that when there's a ghost in the "
"room!? They're so mean to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11804"
msgid "Heh, I suppose you've got a point."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11816"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I just can't deal with spooky situations! I end up lying in bed, "
"freaking out all night, and barely getting a wink of sleep!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11828"
msgid ""
"That's why I get super sleep-deprived whenever I've gotta stay overnight in "
"a hotel..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11840"
msgid "Sounds rough."
msgstr "Sembra dura."

msgctxt "11852"
msgid "It's super rough! What do you think I should do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11864"
msgid "Have a drink or two before you go to bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11876"
msgid ""
"I guess that could work... But what if I don't want to drink that night?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11888"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr "Giusto..."

msgctxt "11900"
msgid "I guess I'd be screwed then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11924"
msgid "Why don't you go stay the night with a friend?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11936"
msgid "Hehehe... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Eheh. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "11948"
msgid ""
"Well, if you insist, I guess I could let you stay the night with me, Kiryu-"
"san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11960"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "11972"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You're going to pin me down onto "
"the bed, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11984"
msgid "Well, that escalated quickly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11996"
msgid "Leave the TV on when you go to sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12008"
msgid "That won't work! I can't fall asleep when the TV's on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12020"
msgid "...Well then, I guess you're out of luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12032"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... ♪ I bet I'd fall asleep pretty quickly if you were snuggling me, "
"Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12044"
msgid "Wait, what?"
msgstr "Ma che?"

msgctxt "12056"
msgid ""
"Though maybe you wouldn't let me sleep at all... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12068"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12080"
msgid ""
"Ooh, Kiryu-san! I found a super yummy okonomiyaki shop\r\n"
"in Tokyo! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12092"
msgid "Really? Where is it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12104"
msgid "It's pretty close to my place, and it has the best pork tamagoyaki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12116"
msgid "Wait, tamagoyaki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12128"
msgid ""
"Yeah! They make the egg sweet and fluffy beyond belief! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12140"
msgid "Isn't it an okonomiyaki place, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12152"
msgid "Hehehe, yeah, it is. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12164"
msgid ""
"So they wrap their amazing pork in these super fluffy eggs... kind of like "
"an omelette!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12176"
msgid ""
"It's even more awesome when you top it with mayo and okonomiyaki sauce!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12188"
msgid "I looove mayo! I'm such a mayo freak. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12200"
msgid "A mayo freak?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12212"
msgid ""
"Yup! But you've gotta mix it with okonomiyaki sauce and ketchup. Then it's "
"perfect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12224"
msgid "Huh."
msgstr "Uh."

msgctxt "12236"
msgid "Are you into mayo, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12248"
msgid "Uh, not exactly..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12260"
msgid ""
"I put mayo on everything. You name it, it's gonna get slathered in mayo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12272"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I could probably survive just off mayo "
"alone! Load me up, let's go! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12284"
msgid "That's... not healthy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12296"
msgid "Sounds delicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12308"
msgid ""
"It's super delicious! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It practically melts in your"
" mouth. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12320"
msgid "Uh-huh..."
msgstr "Uh-uh..."

msgctxt "12332"
msgid "Ooh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I just got an awesome idea!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12344"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "12356"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you should take me there sometime! Please? "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12368"
msgid "...Shouldn't you be the one taking me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12380"
msgid "Watch your weight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12392"
msgid "Huh? Wait, really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12404"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Mayo's not that healthy for you, and if you're putting it on "
"everything you eat, you're bound to start gaining a few pounds."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12416"
msgid ""
"I can't just stop eating mayo! I'm practically married to it! Besides, I'm "
"already a little chubby here and there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12428"
msgid "And I didn't need you to tell me to \"watch my weight\"! Sheesh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12440"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Scusa..."

msgctxt "12452"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san! I bet you're dying to know when my birthday is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12464"
msgid "Uh, not really."
msgstr "Nah, non proprio."

msgctxt "12476"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "12488"
msgid "Well, here it is, anyway! It's May 24th. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12500"
msgid "May 24th... Not near any big holidays, so just a normal day, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12512"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... ♪ Not to my family! Every year, they throw a huge celebration just"
" for me! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12524"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "12536"
msgid ""
"My mom and dad say it's a special day that only comes once a year, so "
"they've got to make it special for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12548"
msgid "That's nice of them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12560"
msgid ""
"...Or maybe they just thought I'd throw a temper tantrum if they didn't "
"shower me with enough attention."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12572"
msgid "Heh. Sounds pretty accurate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12584"
msgid "Anyway, that's why my birthdays are always a blast! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12596"
msgid ""
"I'm always super happy when my birthday rolls around, no matter how old I "
"get! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12608"
msgid "You must really look forward to it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12620"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Everyone gets mega jealous of how awesome my\r\n"
"birthday is. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12632"
msgid ""
"I hope you'll take me somewhere nice to eat for my birthday! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12644"
msgid "Who knows. By that time, I might not be requesting you anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12656"
msgid "Huh? What!? Why not!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12668"
msgid "You... can't even wait till my birthday? It's not that far away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12680"
msgid "Relax. I was just kidding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12692"
msgid "Just so you know, my birthday is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12704"
msgid ""
"And the worst part is I'm always, like, super indecisive about what I want "
"for my birthday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12716"
msgid "...Hello? Are you listening to me?"
msgstr "Pronto? Mi sta ascoltando?"

msgctxt "12728"
msgid "Huh? Did you say something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12740"
msgid "Well, I was about to tell you that my birthday's on..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12752"
msgid ""
"Man, what should I ask for this year? I should probably start talking about "
"it now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12764"
msgid "You're doing this on purpose, aren't you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12776"
msgid "Where did this conversation come from, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12788"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I don't care what you get me, as long as "
"it shows me just how much you love me, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12800"
msgid "...That's what I thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12812"
msgid ""
"Aww, come on! You knew what I was doing? Well then, you know juuust what I "
"want, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12824"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12836"
msgid ""
"So a while back, I went to a doctor for a consultation for plastic surgery. "
"Just wanted to look a little prettier, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12848"
msgid "...Seriously?"
msgstr "...Sul serio?"

msgctxt "12860"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but I found out the procedure I wanted to get is pretty expensive, and"
" they wouldn't do it unless I paid in full before they put me under!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12872"
msgid ""
"I was like, \"Hold on, how much do I have to pay you? Wait, you're going to "
"cut into my what!?\" I totally chickened out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12884"
msgid ""
"So I went for something a little less extreme and got a garlic injection "
"instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12896"
msgid "A garlic injection? Like... with actual garlic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12908"
msgid ""
"It's not actually garlic, silly. It's this shot full of B vitamins that "
"makes all your fatigue melt away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12920"
msgid "Oh... What happened next?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12932"
msgid ""
"Well, I got that garlic injection, and it hurt sooo bad! Like, I was not "
"expecting it to hurt that much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12944"
msgid ""
"Then, I went to walk home, but I started feeling kind of woozy, so I stopped"
" by a police box and asked the officers if I could get a ride home..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12956"
msgid ""
"I explained that I wasn't feeling good, but they just pointed at the bus "
"stop and said I could catch a bus!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12968"
msgid "Heh, that's cold."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12980"
msgid "Seriously! I can't believe they wouldn't listen to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12992"
msgid "I'm not surprised they didn't offer you a ride."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13004"
msgid "What!? Really!? Why!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13016"
msgid "You're lucky they even showed you to the bus stop."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13028"
msgid ""
"Man, you're pretty cold-hearted too, Kiryu-san. Why am I surrounded by all "
"these cold people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13040"
msgid "Maybe you should take a good look in the mirror..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13052"
msgid "Cops aren't taxi drivers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13064"
msgid "I know, but I wasn't feeling good, and I needed a ride home!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13076"
msgid "Yes, but..."
msgstr "Sì, ma..."

msgctxt "13088"
msgid ""
"Policemen are supposed to protect people! If one of their people is feeling "
"sick, then the policemen should help them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13100"
msgid "They're not doctors, you know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13112"
msgid "What are you trying to say here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13124"
msgid ""
"I'm just trying to say that when people don't listen to me, it makes me feel"
" super sad and lonely, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13136"
msgid "I'm listening to you right now, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13148"
msgid "That's true. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13160"
msgid "You're never cold to me, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13172"
msgid "...Wait, weren't we talking about plastic surgery or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13184"
msgid "Kiiiiiiiiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13196"
msgid "Guess what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13208"
msgid "My boyfriend broke up with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13220"
msgid "Really? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13232"
msgid "Well, he came up to me and said..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13244"
msgid "\"I was in love with Yui Hatano. I was never in love with you, Yui.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13256"
msgid "Like, what the hell? What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13268"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13280"
msgid "Seriously, though, I have no idea what he meant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13292"
msgid "He only loved you as a fan, not as a person."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13304"
msgid "Huh!? What does that even mean, though!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13316"
msgid "I don't get it. I'm Yui Hatano! What's the difference!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13328"
msgid "You're right, there is no difference."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13340"
msgid "So why would he say something like that to me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13352"
msgid "Maybe the real you was different from how he'd imagined you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13364"
msgid "Imagined me? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13376"
msgid "He must have imagined what \"Yui Hatano\" was like before he met you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13388"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "13400"
msgid ""
"So his idea of me that he got from watching me on TV is different than who I"
" really am? Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13412"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "13424"
msgid "Oh... Huh..."
msgstr "Uh... uh..."

msgctxt "13436"
msgid "Did I do something to make him stop liking me or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13448"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13460"
msgid "That's really rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13472"
msgid "Rough?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13484"
msgid "The only rough thing about this is trying to figure out what he meant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13496"
msgid "Maybe the real you was different than how he'd imagined you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13508"
msgid "Imagined me? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13520"
msgid "He must have imagined what \"Yui Hatano\" was like before he met you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13532"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "13544"
msgid ""
"So his idea of me that he got from watching me on TV is different than who I"
" really am? Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13556"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "13568"
msgid "Oh... Huh..."
msgstr "Uh... uh..."

msgctxt "13580"
msgid "Did I do something to make him stop liking me or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13592"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13604"
msgid "You really don't know what he meant?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13616"
msgid "No, I don't..."
msgstr "No, non ce l'ho."

msgctxt "13628"
msgid "That's why I'm asking you, Kiryu-san. I really don't get it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13640"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "13652"
msgid "Like, why did he dump me? How's that supposed to be a reason?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13664"
msgid "Maybe the real you was different than how he'd imagined you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13676"
msgid "Imagined me? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13688"
msgid "He must have imagined what \"Yui Hatano\" was like before he met you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13700"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "13712"
msgid ""
"So his idea of me that he got from watching me on TV is different than who I"
" really am? Is that it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13724"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Giusto."

msgctxt "13736"
msgid "Oh... Huh..."
msgstr "Uh... uh..."

msgctxt "13748"
msgid "Did I do something to make him stop liking me or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13760"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13772"
msgid "Ugh, I have such a hard time dealing with one-off customers..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13784"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "Che succede?"

msgctxt "13796"
msgid "So yesterday, I made one of my customers really mad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13808"
msgid "Wow... It's not every day that happens."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13820"
msgid ""
"Yeah! And not only was he a one-off customer, I think it was his first time "
"visiting a hostess club. It felt like he wasn't used to how things work here"
" at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13832"
msgid "I can see how that would make things difficult."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13844"
msgid ""
"I mean, I did get a little bit drunk, so maybe I was a little too mean to "
"him in my banter..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13856"
msgid ""
"Man, I wish I'd treated him better. I'm super disappointed in myself..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13868"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Non preoccuparti."

msgctxt "13880"
msgid "Mmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "13892"
msgid "I mean, I just don't get it. I don't know why it happened at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13904"
msgid "That's why you shouldn't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13916"
msgid ""
"Oh! I remembered something... Maybe it was because I pinched him super "
"hard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13940"
msgid "Did you also bother him about buying you gifts?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13952"
msgid "Bother him? No, I wouldn't do that to him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13964"
msgid ""
"You're the only one I like to bother like that, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "13976"
msgid "Oh, great..."
msgstr "Uh, fantastico..."

msgctxt "13988"
msgid "Were you aware of what you were doing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14000"
msgid "Huh? You mean when I was drunk?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14012"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "14024"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "14036"
msgid "I can't remember..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14048"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14060"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "Ehi, Kiryu-san?"

msgctxt "14072"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "Sì?"

msgctxt "14084"
msgid "How many times have we hung out like this now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14096"
msgid "Hmm... I don't know. Enough that I've lost track."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14108"
msgid "Yeah. We've hung out a lot now, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14120"
msgid "...Is everything all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14132"
msgid "I've just been thinking..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14144"
msgid "Maybe we should stop seeing each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14156"
msgid "Huh? Why?"
msgstr "Eh? Perché?"

msgctxt "14168"
msgid ""
"I'm not really into guys who can't make up their minds, and I'm not into "
"guys who just want to be my customer. I think it's about time I got a real "
"boyfriend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14180"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14192"
msgid "So I think today should be our last day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14204"
msgid "Is that okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14216"
msgid "...I need you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14228"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14240"
msgid "You're just saying that because everyone else can hear you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14252"
msgid "That's not true."
msgstr "Non è vero..."

msgctxt "14264"
msgid "...You mean it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14276"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14288"
msgid "So you'll take me out on a date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14300"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14312"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "14324"
msgid "This is one of your schemes, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14336"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Darn. It didn't work last time, either..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14348"
msgid "Of course it didn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14360"
msgid "Hold on a sec."
msgstr "Aspetta un attimo!"

msgctxt "14372"
msgid "I can't wait for you anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14384"
msgid "I'm serious about us..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14396"
msgid "This is just one of your schemes, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14408"
msgid "Huh? What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Eh? Di che diavolo parli?"

msgctxt "14420"
msgid "You tried this before, remember?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14432"
msgid "What!? I seriously don't know what you're talking about!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14444"
msgid "...I'll take you on a date if you fess up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14456"
msgid "Yep! It was totally a scheme!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14468"
msgid "I knew it."
msgstr "Lo sapevo."

msgctxt "14480"
msgid ""
"Awww, how!? I played it so cool! Did I at least make your heart skip a beat?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14492"
msgid "I won't comment on that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14504"
msgid "So this is how you trap them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14516"
msgid "Huh? Wait, how'd you know!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14528"
msgid "You told me about this exact scheme before."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14540"
msgid "Wait, what!? I did!? When!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14552"
msgid "A while back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14564"
msgid "Ugh... I guess the jig is up, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14576"
msgid "Ooh, I got it! Could you pretend I never asked you that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14588"
msgid "Sorry, no can do."
msgstr "Spiacente, non si può fare."

msgctxt "14600"
msgid "Aww, man! You're so meeeean... ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14612"
msgid "Heh, I suppose I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14624"
msgid ""
"Man, I've just had one bad thing happen after another lately... What's going"
" on with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14636"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14648"
msgid ""
"Did I get cursed? Is that why my luck's been so bad? Oh, man, I heard this "
"happens to people who're gonna die soon! Nooooooo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14660"
msgid "Calm down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14672"
msgid "I'll try, but literally nothing's gone right for me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14684"
msgid ""
"My boyfriend dumped me, everyone's mad at me, and my old friends keep "
"yelling at me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14696"
msgid "You won't take me on a date, or even ask me on one, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14708"
msgid "Those mean the same thing, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14720"
msgid ""
"Ugh... I'm so going to die, aren't I? I should tell my mom and dad I love "
"them..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14732"
msgid "Relax. You're not going to die."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14744"
msgid "Are you sure? You're really sure? I'm going to be okay, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14756"
msgid "You'll be fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14768"
msgid "But you still don't go on a date with me, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14780"
msgid "...All in good time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14792"
msgid ""
"Sure, but I don't want to go on some informal after-hours date! I want to go"
" on a real, formal date with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14804"
msgid "All right, all right."
msgstr "Va bene, va bene."

msgctxt "14816"
msgid "Promise? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14828"
msgid "Promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14840"
msgid "Want to go on a date?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14852"
msgid "...Really?"
msgstr "...Davvero?"

msgctxt "14864"
msgid "Really."
msgstr "Davvero."

msgctxt "14876"
msgid "Hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> When, then? I'm free tomorrow. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14888"
msgid "Tomorrow? Let me think..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14900"
msgid ""
"Oh! No, never mind, actually. You sound like you're kinda hesitating..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14924"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Non preoccuparti."

msgctxt "14936"
msgid ""
"You say that like you don't even care about me, Kiryu-san! You're so cold..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14948"
msgid "Well, what do you want me to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14960"
msgid "What do you want to do about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14972"
msgid "Well, I was hoping you'd ask me out on a date, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14984"
msgid "Want to go on a date, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "14996"
msgid "...Really?"
msgstr "...Davvero?"

msgctxt "15008"
msgid "Really."
msgstr "Davvero."

msgctxt "15020"
msgid "Hehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> When, then? I'm free tomorrow. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15032"
msgid "Tomorrow? Let me think..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15044"
msgid ""
"Oh! No, never mind, actually. You sound like you're kinda hesitating..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15056"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15068"
msgid "Oh man, something super gross happened to me today!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15080"
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "Che è successo?"

msgctxt "15092"
msgid "Some guy felt me up on the train!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15104"
msgid "That's awful."
msgstr "Terribile."

msgctxt "15116"
msgid "It totally freaked me out! I was like, why is this guy touching me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15128"
msgid "I was so scared and confused, I couldn't even say anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15140"
msgid "And then he ran off the train at the next stop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15152"
msgid ""
"I got off the train and ran after him to try to catch him. I even lobbed a "
"plastic bottle at his head!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15164"
msgid "Wow, go you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15176"
msgid "Yeah, but he still got away..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15188"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "15200"
msgid "I was wearing heels, and carrying a whole bunch of stuff..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15212"
msgid "But I didn't give up, no sir!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15224"
msgid ""
"I went to one of the station employees and asked them to try and find him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15236"
msgid "What happened then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15248"
msgid "They asked me what he looked like, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15260"
msgid ""
"And I was like, \"Don't you have security cameras all over the place? You "
"probably have him on video!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15272"
msgid "But they said, \"Oh, those are fake cameras!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15284"
msgid "That's when I knew there was no hope..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15296"
msgid "...I'm sorry."
msgstr "...Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "15308"
msgid "I felt so violated when he started feeling me up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15320"
msgid "Now I'm feeling like, scared and frustrated about the whole thing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15332"
msgid "I'm sorry that happened to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15344"
msgid ""
"Thanks. The worst thing is, when my girlfriends tell me some guy touched "
"them on the train, I say, \"Well, why didn't you scream 'STOP!'\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15356"
msgid ""
"But when it happened to me, I couldn't do anything, let alone scream! I just"
" froze."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15368"
msgid "I feel awful just thinking about what happened..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15380"
msgid "I couldn't do anything to stop it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15392"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15404"
msgid "Did you go to the police?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15416"
msgid "...No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15428"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "Perché no?"

msgctxt "15440"
msgid "Well, 'cause they'd start asking me a bunch of questions about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15452"
msgid "I don't want to relive that experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15464"
msgid "Makes sense..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15476"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15488"
msgid "Kiryu-san, if you had been there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15500"
msgid "If you had been there, would you have protected me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15512"
msgid "Of course I would have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "15524"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Eheh. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

msgctxt "15536"
msgid "I feel a lot better now, thanks. ♪"
